OL,3,GNEWSAStretch of A38 reopens after two
OL,4,Alorries crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FPart of the A38 in Derbyshire has
OL,7,Freopened following a crash involving
OL,8,Ftwo lorries.
OL,10,FDerbyshire Police said it was called to
OL,11,Fa southbound stretch of carriageway
OL,12,Fnear the Egginton junction at 15:42 BST
OL,13,Fon Tuesday.
OL,15,FThe road was closed at the junction
OL,16,Fwhile emergency services dealt with the
OL,17,Fcrash.
OL,19,FIn an update at 18:08, the force said
OL,20,Fthe road had reopened.
